 proof of his steady and ethical leadership.His political awakening volunteering in the East End of London was instrumental in redrawing his map of Britain's class and economic system. Growing up in the comfortable coda of the Victorian era, he foresaw an epoch of change - one that he was pivotal to bring about in the post-war years. After serving at Gallipoli during the First Word War he rose through the ranks of the Labour Party and during the Second World War became Britain's first Deputy Prime Minister. In 1945, in the glow of Churchill's great war victory, Attlee won the election by a landslide.","pageCount":544,"publicationYear":2016,"displaySummary":"In 1945, in the glow of Churchill's great war victory, Attlee won the election by a landslide.","primarySubject":"Biography","primaryTopic":"World War I","subjectEvidence":{"primarySubject":"Biography","confidence":"medium","method":"evidence_score","candidates":[{"subject":"Biography","score":30,"evidenceCount":5},{"subject":"Politics & Government","score":15,"evidenceCount":3},{"subject":"Arts & Criticism","score":10,"evidenceCount":2},{"subject":"History","score":6,"evidenceCount":2}],"evidence":[{"source":"open_library","scheme":"open_library_subject","rawLabel":"Attlee, c. r. (clement richard), 1883-1967","mappedSubject":"Biography","score":6,"confidence":"high","sourceId":"source-open-library-citizen-clem-a-biography-of-attlee-john-bew","id":"subject-evidence-book-citizen-clem-a-biography-of-attlee-john-bew-1"},{"source":"open_library","scheme":"open_library_subject","rawLabel":"Great britain, politics and government, 1945-1979","mappedSubject":"Biography","score":6,"confidence":"high","sourceId":"source-open-library-citizen-clem-a-biography-of-attlee-john-bew","id":"subject-evidence-book-citizen-clem-a-biography-of-attlee-john-bew-2"},{"source":"open_library","scheme":"open_library_subject","rawLabel":"Labour Party (Great Britain) -- Biography","mappedSubject":"Biography","score":6,"confidence":"high","sou